 the corporate ladder and take down Ever After Inc. from the inside!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996390/extras/b5ef4a6b8f56b61f9346108209e64b49.poster.avif?t=1770389540\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996390/extras/b5ef4a6b8f56b61f9346108209e64b49.webm?t=1770389540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996390/extras/b5ef4a6b8f56b61f9346108209e64b49.mp4?t=1770389540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996390/extras/6d3f3ff8fbaaf0be97f19ca1a64b9b35.avif?t=1770389540\" width=600 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into storybook worlds packed to the brim with colorful characters, captivating locales, and electrifying secrets! One moment you\u2019ll be fleeing Lovecraftian terrors while solving a noir murder mystery, and the next you\u2019ll be up against villainous versions of The Three Little Pigs as they try to bulldoze a fairytale forest for their real estate developments. The rules are always changing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996390/extras/a7e6d615ed11fa9508c4be0c10028817.poster.avif?t=1770389540\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996390/extras/a7e6d615ed11fa9508c4be0c10028817.webm?t=1770389540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st